{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12416","headline":"送兴平王少府游梁 · 钱起","name":"送兴平王少府游梁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧识相逢情更亲，攀欢甚少怆离频。\n黄绶罢来多远客，青山何处不愁人。\n日斜官树闻蝉满，雨过关城见月新。\n梁国遗风重词赋，诸侯应念马卿贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}